---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1> Logic Explored </h1>
			<p>
				Using data to answer meaningful questions. Every project starts with a question. Data provides the answer and design makes it possible.
				
			</p>
			<p>
                
			</p>
			<p>
			    
			</p>
			<p> 
				In a world with this much information, its important to understand the data that surrounds your everday life.
			</p>
			<p>
			    How do we turn information into clarity? How can we make better decisions in a complex world? What can data reveal about the systems shaping everyday life?
			</p>
			<p>Here are a few ideas on how to get started with the template:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Edit this page in <code>src/pages/index.astro</code></li>
				<li>Edit the site header items in <code>src/components/Header.astro</code></li>
				<li>Add your name to the footer in <code>src/components/Footer.astro</code></li>
				<li>Check out the included blog posts in <code>src/content/blog/</code></li>
				<li>Customize the blog post page layout in <code>src/layouts/BlogPost.astro</code></li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				
			</p>
			<p>
			
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
